{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:37594168\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述将STN定位为行为中断信号节点，并梳理脑干向STN等基底节节点的输入，可为FOG的异常动作停止机制及脑干门控机制提供重要理论依据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:37594791\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"该综述聚焦PD住院照护中的可穿戴设备应用特征，未提供FOG特异性神经机制或STN神经活动证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:37597816\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接研究PD-FOG患者的动态功能网络连接，发现默认网络与基底节网络耦合异常，可提供STN局部活动之外的分布式网络机制证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:37611096\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究的是帕金森模型中的丘脑至运动皮层突触适应，未测量FOG或STN相关神经活动，无法直接解释两者关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:37634658\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"虽然数据集包含FOG患者，但实际分类目标是区分PD与健康人及评估药物效果，并未研究FOG机制或STN活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:37635781\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"虽然研究STN-DBS临床结局，但主要分析总体UPDRS-III改善及其预测因素，没有提供FOG特异性结局或STN神经活动证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:37637981\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"该观点综述将冻结步态列为左旋多巴反应不佳的晚期表现，并强调非多巴胺能网络和核团的参与，可用于解释FOG的非多巴胺能机制及治疗反应异质性。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:37637990\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"该综述涵盖FOG及其代偿策略和潜在机制，可补充注意控制、外部线索、运动意象及自动步行控制等非STN机制解释。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:37660541\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究的是PD患者认知状态与一般步态和平衡表现的关系，未区分FOG或测量STN活动，无法回答目标神经活动关联。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:37666830\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究对象为强迫行为小鼠模型，刺激靶点为内囊而非STN，且不涉及PD或FOG，不能提供目标问题所需证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:37677065\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"虽然研究PD中的边缘-运动网络和动作控制，但没有涉及冻结步态或STN神经活动，与目标问题的关联过于间接。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:37689706\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接比较左旋多巴未治疗与长期治疗PD患者的FOG发生率，可用于检验药物暴露和多巴胺状态是否造成FOG异质性及影响STN-FOG关联。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:37692820\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"系统综述总结了FOG相关的感觉运动皮层、丘脑结构损伤及白质连接异常，可提供STN之外的结构网络机制证据和比较依据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:37702175\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"通过动物光遗传实验揭示PPN-GABA能通路对多巴胺神经元及动作启动和序列执行的门控作用，可作为FOG脑干动作启动障碍的候选机制证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:37736618\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"该研究主要开发和验证FOG实时检测及治疗系统，没有分析STN或其他脑网络的神经活动，不能回答目标机制关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:37739964\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究的是小鼠背外侧纹状体的多巴胺动态信号，未涉及PD、FOG或STN，无法提供目标问题的直接或有力间接证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:37744179\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"虽然研究PD患者的皮层-肌肉网络及运动相关生理活动，但重点是睡眠状态下的网络变化，没有涉及FOG或STN活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:37751468\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"该研究提出基底节直接和间接通路共同调节动作选择的模型，但没有研究PD、STN或FOG，缺乏与目标机制的特异联系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:37752107\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究PD患者受体分布与运动及视空间症状轴的关系，但未分析FOG或STN神经活动，不能区分冻结步态相关机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:37761336\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究早发与晚发PD的皮层功能改变，没有FOG分层或STN活动指标，与目标问题仅存在一般性疾病背景关联。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:37772512\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接比较FOG与非FOG患者的视觉探索及视觉线索反应，可支持视空间和认知控制参与FOG的机制，并解释不同任务条件下神经活动关联的差异。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:37781564\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究慢性应激导致小鼠纹状体直接通路去抑制的机制，研究背景为强迫症和抽动障碍，不涉及PD、STN或FOG。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:37801492\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"该研究验证猕猴皮层和壳核的多功能纤维记录与调控技术，没有研究STN、PD或FOG，技术方法本身不足以回答目标问题。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:37802381\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"该综述聚焦PD多巴胺神经元谷氨酸和GABA共释放及其疾病相关变化，但没有将这些机制与FOG或STN特异性神经活动联系起来。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:37804833\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"该综述主要介绍清醒动物深脑荧光记录的技术方法，没有提供STN-FOG相关的原始数据或机制证据。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c138ba8f-4688-4b90-b94e-f2d0ef6372ea", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T160201366549Z", "elapsed_seconds": 214.953, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T16:05:36.319825+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2ae41a9d94e4c847175c7b54ff43942cb715bcedef2927ef40a964211c51add9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T160201366549Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "9a5ab17f49dd43426a360b60917f684d0c000cf65b4ed29e2d29f12be0f1ee1a"}}}
